WEBVTT

00:18:29.619 --> 00:18:33.859
quando preciso de voltar a ligar-me
àquele sentimento,

00:18:34.279 --> 00:18:36.379
recordo as palavras dele.

00:18:36.569 --> 00:18:38.569
Foram muito poderosas:

00:18:38.799 --> 00:18:42.329
[Só há tempo suficiente
para engomares a tua capa

00:18:42.329 --> 00:18:44.709
[e voltares para o céu].

00:18:46.449 --> 00:18:48.579
♫ Super-herói, super-herói ♫

00:18:48.799 --> 00:18:50.889
♫ Super-herói, super-herói ♫

00:18:53.179 --> 00:18:55.539
♫ Super-herói, super-herói ♫

00:18:55.759 --> 00:18:57.929
♫ Super-herói, super-herói ♫

00:18:58.199 --> 00:19:00.329
♫ Super-herói, super-herói ♫